window.bookSummaryJSON = "<i><b>Unearth the intoxicating allure of 'The Crimson Legacy,'</b></i><br><br>The last of the Crimson bloodline, Bethany Crimson, a formidable woman from a small island, discovers she is the last of magical warriors created to restore balance in a tumultuous world overran by repulsing creatures that feast upon human beings for sport and a pleasant drug to get high on.<br><br>Bethany's lineage keeps many hidden secrets about her <i>true </i>identity. Alone, without guidance, she will have to uncover who she is while she tackles many foes.<br><br>Danger lurks in the shadows. Will she discover her identity in time to protect all that she loves?<br>Her husband, children and friends are all in danger.<br>It will be a hefty price to pay. She may have to pay for it with her life.<br><br><i>Can a mother's love defy the gods themselves? Dive into a world where love is the ultimate weapon, and salvation comes at the edge of a sword. A tale so spellbinding, it will defy your very concept of fate. Are you ready to challenge the heavens?</i><br><br>Read this book for <i><b>free </b></i>with your kindle subscription or simply purchase it for the selling price of a small coffee."; 
